    "title": "Who Is 'The Real Housewives Of Rhode Island' Star Kelsey Swanson's Secret Boyfriend She Refuses To Name?",
    "text": "Published April 2, 2026, 9:00 p.m. ET Decider's Guide to Who's Who In 'The Real Housewives Of Rhode Island'0 seconds of 4 minutes, 37 secondsVolume 0% The Real Housewives of Rhode Island has finally premiered on Bravo, and these women are already giving us so much and more. At the center of it all, however, is Kelsey Swanson, whose unconventional relationship with a much-older man is the talk of the town. Swanson, who is turning 30 in the show, shares that she met her unnamed boyfriend on a boat when she was 19 years old. These days, she describes herself as a “lady of leisure” who lives in said boyfriend’s 16,000 square foot home, which consists of four kitchens and 79 TVs. While she didn’t share his identity, Swanson said her boyfriend is from “one of the most prominent families” in Rhode Island, and that he’s the one who pushed her to become Miss Rhode Island 2017. Their relationship is rather unorthodox. According to Swanson, when her boyfriend is living in Miami the first part of the year, he has a different girlfriend in Florida. Now that Swanson is approaching 30 and looking for more of a committed relationship, she’s wondering if this arrangement is still the best thing for her. So, who is this man Swanson has been seeing for the last decade? The Real Housewives of Rhode Island has not named him, but we have a guess or two. Keep reading. Who is Kelsey Swanson’s boyfriend? The short answer? We don’t know. Swanson doesn’t reveal her boyfriend’s name in the show, and his face is blurred out of any photos. However, we were able to do some digging, and here’s what we found. Per Distractify, Instagram gossip page Deuxmoi claimed Swanson was “in a long-term open relationship with a very well-known judge’s son,” whose father was “known for his theatrics in the courtroom and loved being filmed for his own show.” A Rhode Island lifestyle page also seemed to corroborate this information. Visit Advertiser websiteGO TO PAGEAfter a quick Google search, we found that Judge Frank Caprio—who died in August 2025 at the age of 88—was a prominent judge in Rhode Island who starred in Caught in Providence. The show, which ran from 2018 to 2020, filmed real people as they stood before Judge Caprio in the Providence Municipal Court and pleaded their real-life case. Side note, Swanson appeared on a 2019 episode of Caught in Providence to assist the judge in a case. Judge Caprio does have four sons, but we think we’ve narrowed things down to two of them, starting with David Caprio, a 58-year-old businessman and politician who served as a member of the Rhode Island House of Representatives from 1999 to 2010. David, who was linked to Swanson in the aforementioned post, has a good-sized Instagram following (about 23.7K followers at the time of this writing), some of which include … wait for it … The Real Housewives of Rhode Island stars. Not only are he and Swanson following each other, but Jo-Ellen Tiberi and Liz McGraw also follow him. If you remember, Tiberi and Swanson have known each other for over two decades, so it would make sense for him to follow her back. Plus, McGraw shared in the show that she grew up with Swanson’s boyfriend, and David is around the same age as her. Still not convinced? Well, David is also a real estate investor with interests in numerous places, including Florida, where he spent a lot of time with his father, who was being treated at the Miami Cancer Institute before he passed away. David’s profile picture is also a photo of him and his dad in Miami. MIAMI?! OTHER GIRLFRIEND?! Seems like we’re getting warmer and warmer. If David is not our mystery man, it’s also possible that Swanson could be dating his younger brother, John Caprio, who is reportedly around 54 years old and has a residence in Miami. Swanson and John also follow each other on Instagram. When Judge Caprio passed away last year, Swanson commented, “Like father, like son ❤️,” on one of his posts. Not only were the two linked in a Reddit post about the new show earlier this year, but Swanson also told Swoon that her boyfriend was 23 years older than her, which sounds a bit closer to her age gap with John. Bravo was unable to comment on the identity of Swanson’s boyfriend when DECIDER reached out for confirmation. Until there’s some solid confirmation from either party, we suggest taking this evidence with a grain of salt. UPDATE 4/3/26: Swanson can be seen dancing and posing with John Caprio, son of Judge Frank Caprio, in an Instagram post from September 2024. It looks like we may have found our guy! Photo: Bravo How to watch The Real Housewives of Rhode Island: Those looking to watch The Real Housewives of Rhode Island will need access to Bravo and/or Peacock. If you have a cable subscription, you can access the network on the BravoTV website, or stream the show live on platforms like Fubo, YouTube TV, Hulu + Live TV and Sling TV when it airs on Thursday nights at 9 p.m. ET/PT. New episodes also become available the next day on Peacock. Peacock currently offers two subscription types: Premium with ads and Premium Plus ad-free. Peacock Premium costs $10.99/month, while Premium Plus costs $16.99/month. You can save a bit by subscribing to one of Peacock’s annual plans, which give you 12 months for the price of 10. These cost either $109.99 with ads or $169.99 without ads. Peacock Premium Plus is also available to subscribe to via Prime Video with a seven-day free trial that you can’t get by subscribing directly on Peacock. Tags Bravo Dolores Catania The Real Housewives of Rhode Island",
